### 🏗️ Architecture Overview

**8-Category Scripts Structure**:
1. **Managers/** (19 files) - Core game management
2. **Player/** (16 files) - 3 character classes + systems
3. **Weapon/** (6 files) - IWeapon interface + implementations
4. **UI/** (4 subcategories) - Organized by functionality
5. **Enemies/** (4 subcategories) - AI, Health, Boss, Projectile
6. **Systems/** (3 files) - Sound, Save, Shop
7. **Items/** (4 files) - Pickup, Data, Inventory
8. **Misc/** (12 files) - Utilities and helpers

**Scene Flow**: Lobby → Loading → Scene1 → Scene2 → Scene3

